# Mach-O exported-symbols list for libmpv.dylib (macOS and iOS).
# Passed to ld64 via -Wl,-exported_symbols_list,... (patch_export_filter.py).
#
# Only the public mpv_* C API, plus the mak_pcm_* live PCM API
# (patch_pcm_stream.py), leaks into the .dylib's dynamic symbol table.
# All ffmpeg / freetype / fribidi / harfbuzz / fontconfig / libass / libplacebo /
# libsmb2 / libxml2 / speexdsp (/ rubberband in the GPL build) internals stay
# private (they were also linked statically; without this list they would be
# exported and clash-prone with other Flutter plugins linking the same libs).
_mpv_*
# The mak_pcm_* API as a glob: ld64 rejects a listed symbol that is not
# defined, so meson's link test of this flag failed and dropped the whole
# list. A wildcard skips hidden symbols, so the internal mak_pcm_tap_*
# (hidden like every mpv symbol) stays out; verify counts exactly nine.
_mak_pcm_*
